{
  "dom_id": "step-29138",
  "name": "Example: \n                    Finding the Scale Factor of a Dilation in the Coordinate Plane",
  "problem": "![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14221848/assets/cd07f68993f7e151e2b24fe9305b726ce40b9bc5f56399d6616e46c83f90cc87.png)\n\n \n\nThe point $P'(-2,-4)$ is the image of the point $P(1,2)$ under a dilation with the center at the origin, as shown above. What is the scale factor of the transformation?",
  "worked_solution": "A dilation with center at the origin and a factor of $k$ can be represented by the function \n\n$$\n(x,y) \\mapsto (kx,ky)\\,.\n$$\n\nApplying this function to the point $P$ and equating the result to $P',$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(k\\cdot 1,k\\cdot 2)=(-2,-4)\\,⟹\\,\\{\\begin{aligned}k=-2 \\\\ 2k=-4.\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, $k=\\dfrac{(-4)}{2}=-2.$\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14221848/assets/219980e6dee08094db21c153f37b107d6fd85709aa50cf8c546a5ba050aac567.png)",
  "calculator_instructions": "",
  "fields": [],
  "problem_field_keys": [],
  "answer_fields_complete": null,
  "result": null,
  "proof_feedback": null,
  "html": "<div id=\"step-29138\" class=\"step\" style=\"display: block\" stepid=\"29138\" steptype=\"example\" contentid=\"7843\">\n            <div class=\"stepHeader\">\n                <div class=\"stepName\">\n                    Example: \n                    <a id=\"stepAnchor-29138\" class=\"stepAnchor\" style=\"font-weight: normal;\" name=\"step-9\">Finding the Scale Factor of a Dilation in the Coordinate Plane</a> \n                </div>      \n                <div class=\"helpButton\" stepid=\"29138\">?</div>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class=\"exampleQuestion\">\n                <style type=\"text/css\">\n                            .mjpage .MJX-monospace {\n                            font-family: monospace\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage .MJX-sans-serif {\n                            font-family: sans-serif\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage {\n                            display: inline;\n                            font-style: normal;\n                            font-weight: normal;\n                            line-height: normal;\n                            font-size: 100%;\n                            font-size-adjust: none;\n                            text-indent: 0;\n                            text-align: left;\n                            text-transform: none;\n                            letter-spacing: normal;\n                            word-spacing: normal;\n                            word-wrap: normal;\n                            white-space: nowrap;\n                            float: none;\n                            direction: ltr;\n                            max-width: none;\n                            max-height: none;\n                            min-width: 0;\n                            min-height: 0;\n                            border: 0;\n                            padding: 0;\n                            margin: 0\n     